6.3 Referential Integrity
Every lifecycle_event.lifecycle_id must exist in claim_lifecycle.

Every event_driver.event_id must exist in lifecycle_event.

Every event_actor.event_id must exist in lifecycle_event.

Every event_evidence.event_id must exist in lifecycle_event.

Every key_event.lifecycle_id must exist in claim_lifecycle.

Every claim_relation.lifecycle_id and claim_relation.related_claim_id must exist in claim_lifecycle.

Every source_link.lifecycle_id must exist in claim_lifecycle.

Every provenance.lifecycle_id must exist in claim_lifecycle.

Every moderation.lifecycle_id must exist in claim_lifecycle.

The version chain must be acyclic.

The claim relation must be symmetric where appropriate.

