12. Validation Engine Design
The system validates the following.

Validation 1. Lifecycle validity. Every lifecycle is validated against the schema.

Validation 2. Referential integrity.

Validation 3. Version chain acyclicity.

Validation 4. Source claim resolution. Every source claim reference must resolve or be flagged.

Validation 5. Provenance completeness.

Validation 6. Audit completeness.

Validation 7. Moderation completeness.

Validation 8. Status consistency. The current status must be consistent with the lifecycle events.

Validation 9. Trajectory consistency. The trajectory must be consistent with the recent events.

Validation 10. Relation consistency. The relations must be consistent with the source apps.

Validation 11. Event sequence consistency. The lifecycle events must be in chronological order.

